	spec: 'File tracking records declared files only (task 8w). Edit notes (task 0f) come from declarations only and report activity; files have no owners. SYSTEM.md says once: edit notes show recent activity; no session owns a file or is responsible for its failing tests, and any session that finds a failure may fix it. The modifies line in SYSTEM.md drops the Git status sentence.',
